  "items": [
    {
      "name": "FEATURE: Shopping Cart",
      "description": "BENEFIT: Shoppers can manage items in a shopping cart for immediate or future purchase\n\nAC: \nShoppers can easily access their cart from any page, \nChange the quantity, \nAdd & remove it from their cart. \nA subtotal for all items in their shopping cart should be displayed at the bottom. \nCheck out button is at the bottom of the cart.\nIntegrate with inventory mgmt.",
      "itemType": {
        "id": "T1599768734490ZSAVB3MLEHKWGXL",
        "name": "Text",
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Access Cart",
      "description": "As a Shopper\nI want to access my shopping card from any page\nSo that I can access my shopping cart easily\n\nAC \nGiven that I am a shopper on the website\nWhen I am on any page on the website\nThen the shopping cart icon is visible in the upper right-hand corner\n\nGiven that I am a shopper browsing on any page\nWhen I select/click the shopping cart icon\nThen I am routed to the shopping cart page\n\nGiven that I am a shopper on any page\nWhen I hover over the icon \nThen I can see a modal preview of what I have in my cart\n\nGiven that I have nothing in my cart\nWhen I select the shopping cart icon\nThen I am notified that my cart is empty w/a pop-up close to the cart icon",
      "itemType": {
        "id": "T1599768734490ZSAVB3MLEHKWGXL",
        "name": "Text",
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Add Item to cart",
      "description": "As a Shopper\nI want to add books to the cart and update quantity\nSo that I can manage my book purchase and quantity",
      "itemType": {
        "id": "T1599768734490ZSAVB3MLEHKWGXL",
        "name": "Text",
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Remove item from the cart",
      "description": "As a Shopper\nI want to remove books from the cart\nSo that I can manage the books I want to purchase",
      "itemType": {
        "id": "T1599768734490ZSAVB3MLEHKWGXL",
        "name": "Text",
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "View cart total",
      "description": "As a Shopper\nI want to see individual and total price for all items in my cart\nSo that I can do an informed purchase",
      "itemType": {
        "id": "T1599768734490ZSAVB3MLEHKWGXL",
        "name": "Text",
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Checkout",
      "description": "As a Shopper\nI want to check out the cart\nSo that I can complete the purchase of the selected books\n\nAC\nGiven that I have added all the books I want to purchase in my cart and on the shopping cart page\nWhen I click on \"checkout\"\nThen I am navigated to the checkout page \n\nGiven that I am on the checkout page\nWhen the checkout page loads\nThen I am able to see the sum total of my items for purchase, sum quantities, and total amount to purchase \n\nGiven that I am on shopping cart page with no items \nWhen I click on checkout\nThen I receive a message that there are no items to purchase greyed out \n\nGiven that I have items in my shopping cart and the availability of the item has changed since adding \nWhen I click the check out button\nThen I receive a message that the item(s) and/or quantity are no longer available",
      "itemType": {
        "id": "T1599768734490ZSAVB3MLEHKWGXL",
        "name": "Text",
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Inventory Management integration",
      "description": "Description: Implement integration between the Shopping Cart service and Inventory Management system to enable real-time inventory validation, reservation, and stock synchronization throughout the shopping journey. This capability will ensure accurate product availability is presented to customers, prevent overselling, and maintain inventory consistency across catalog, cart, checkout, and order management systems.\n\nThe integration should support inventory availability checks when products are added to the cart, quantity updates within the cart, inventory reservation during checkout, and inventory deduction upon successful order completion.\nAC:\nShopping Cart service must invoke Inventory APIs to validate stock availability when a product is added to the cart.",
      "itemType": {
        "id": "T1599768734490ZSAVB3MLEHKWGXL",
        "name": "Text",
        "description": ""
      }
    },
